menu "X3 Thermostat"

    config SC_PLC_MC200_STANDIN
        bool "PLC: bench MC200 stand-in (plc_mc200)"
        default n
        help
            Bench only. Builds the plc_mc200 console command, which polls one
            DT-200 or LT200SPD and answers it the way the MC200 does, so PLC
            TX can be tested on a bus with no MC200. Never enable it in the
            firmware that goes on the real boiler bus: two pollers would
            collide. Build with sdkconfig.bench (see docs/plc-protocol.md §6.4).

endmenu
